                <head>Unperfected convention between the United States and Panama providing for the
                    transfer to Panama of two naval radio stations, signed March 2, 1936</head>
                <p>[Text printed as Ex. D, 74th Cong., 2d sess.; also printed in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Congressional Record</hi>, vol. 86, pt. 12, p. 13803.
                    This convention was approved by the Senate on December 2, 1940 (see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>), but was never ratified.]</p>
            </div>
